WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.701
-Welcome, everybody,
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.703
Thank you so much for watching.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:04.971
What a show we have
for you tonight.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:09.342
Oh, also, I'm going to debut
my new Zoom camera.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.810
I have a new Zoom camera.
It doesn't quite work.

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.247
It's a little wide-angled
and it's weird-looking.

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:16.348
But -- You got to --
You got to try.

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:17.717
You got to try new things

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:21.121
and see what works and what
doesn't work and all that.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:23.322
I hope everyone
is staying safe out there.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:26.126
I know it's tempting to just
"enough's enough,"

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.228
but, yeah, you're doing
the right thing.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:32.231
Wear masks, wear gloves, stay
home when you can,

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:34.701
social-distance,
do everything you can.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.803
Let's get rid of this thing.

00:00:36.803 --> 00:00:37.904
What a show.

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:39.138
I'll just run through it
real quick.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:41.440
Martin Short,
the funniest human of all time.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.609
Love him so much.

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.643
He's just on fire.
He's just the greatest.

00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:47.147
I love him, love him, love him
so much.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:51.517
Also, speaking of funny, I met
them as writers on "Late Night,"

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:54.186
and now they are just ruling
the world right now

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:56.288
and hitting home runs,

00:00:56.288 --> 00:00:58.625
comedy home runs,
all over the place.

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:01.528
Bashir Salahuddin and
Diallo Riddle,

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:05.298
the creators of "South Side"
and also "Sherman's Showcase,"

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:09.835
which is having their
Black History Month spectacular,

00:01:09.835 --> 00:01:11.104
airing this Friday.

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.739
Man, they are so funny.
It's unbelievable.

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:18.077
The special is great.
Quest is in it. It's awesome.

00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:19.545
And to close it out, honey,

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:20.880
do you know who
the musical guest is tonight?

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.682
-No, I do not.
-Well, well, well.

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:26.752
Who's one of my favorites
of all time?

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:28.688
-Is that a trick question?
-No, no. I'm sorry.

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:34.560
But -- Our -- Mutually,
who is one of the first

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.429
few people that we listened to?

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:38.965
Well, no, no,
it's endless, endless.

00:01:38.965 --> 00:01:40.266
-Oh, I know.
-Ready?

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.533
-Yes. I was going through
who hadn't --

00:01:41.533 --> 00:01:42.635
-I know --
there's a lot of people.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:44.270
-Yes.
-Randy Newman.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.272
-Stop it.
-Randy Newman is tonight.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:48.307
-Oh, this is a big one.
-I love Randy Newman.

00:01:48.307 --> 00:01:51.311
-Oh, my gosh.
-And he's my man.

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:54.013
-Yeah, I just -- I don't know.
What a show.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.614
Alright, let's get to
some news here.

00:01:55.614 --> 00:01:58.584
Here we go.
Let's get right to it.

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:02.021
Today started off with some
big news from the Supreme Court.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.123
-We have breaking news from
the Supreme Court.

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:07.426
It is a landmark decision
for the LGBTQ community.

00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:10.697
The justices ruling that it is
illegal for workers

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:12.932
to be dismissed
from a job based on

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.602
sexual orientation
and gender identity.

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:18.071
-Oh, my gosh. Oh, my gosh.
It's 2020.

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:21.207
I thought good news was illegal.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:23.843
Until this, the only good news
to come out of 2020

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:26.078
was Baby Nut.

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:29.415
Yeah, it's not the outcome
the Trump administration wanted.

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:31.484
Experts say it's the
most damaging thing to happen

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:35.288
to Trump in the
last...eight hours.

00:02:35.288 --> 00:02:38.657
That was for watch,
wearing a watch.

00:02:38.657 --> 00:02:41.894
People used to wear timepieces.

00:02:41.894 --> 00:02:44.463
Yep, the decision protects
gay and transgender workers

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:46.665
from discrimination
in the workplace.

00:02:46.665 --> 00:02:48.967
Unfortunately, thanks to Trump's
handling of the pandemic,

00:02:48.967 --> 00:02:52.805
there is no workplace.

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:55.475
The court decided employers
can't fire workers

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:58.644
based on their sexual
orientation or gender identity.

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:00.379
They'll have to stick to
the usual reason workers

00:03:00.379 --> 00:03:04.317
get fired -- not muting
themselves on Zoom.

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:06.285
The final vote was 6-3.

00:03:06.285 --> 00:03:07.486
When he heard that, Trump said,

00:03:07.486 --> 00:03:11.057
"Okay, what about
the Electoral College?"

00:03:11.057 --> 00:03:13.759
Yep, it's a tough day for
the Trump administration.

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:16.061
We're just one more
"Will &amp; Grace" reboot away

00:03:16.061 --> 00:03:20.399
from this being the worst day
of Mike Pence's life.

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:22.501
The 6-3 opinion was written by

00:03:22.501 --> 00:03:25.171
Trump-appointed justice
Neil Gorsuch.

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:27.073
Trump plans on punishing Gorsuch

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.342
by violently shaking
his hand again.

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.377
[ Applause ]

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:35.348
-What's he doing?

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:38.985
It's like he's trying to
start a lawnmower.

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:41.754
That's like -- You know who
would do those handshakes?

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:44.189
Kreskin would do that
when he came on the show.

00:03:44.189 --> 00:03:45.725
And I always thought that was
part of the trick or something,

00:03:45.725 --> 00:03:47.860
'cause I'd go, "Nice to see
you," and he'd go...

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:49.261
And he'd shake it
really hard and you'd go,

00:03:49.261 --> 00:03:51.297
"Is this part of the -- Did
he just put something on my back

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:52.598
by distracting me?"

00:03:52.598 --> 00:03:54.701
No, it's just the way
he shook hands.

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:56.202
Hi, Kreskin.

00:03:59.705 --> 00:04:02.241
Well, everyone is
talking about this. Everybody.

00:04:02.241 --> 00:04:03.509
Over the weekend,
President Trump

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:05.878
gave a commencement speech
at West Point,

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:08.081
but it looks like
he had some trouble leaving.

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.414
Take a look.

00:04:09.414 --> 00:04:14.553
-You see him walking very
haltingly, one leg at a time.

00:04:14.553 --> 00:04:18.090
It starts happening here.
Down a ramp.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.159
-Yeah, apparently,
Trump was a little sensitive

00:04:20.159 --> 00:04:23.195
about the incident,
because he then tweeted,

00:04:23.195 --> 00:04:25.998
"The ramp that I descended
was very long and steep,

00:04:25.998 --> 00:04:27.733
had no handrail,
and, most importantly,

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:29.335
it was very slippery.

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:32.304
Final 10 feet,
I ran down to level ground.

00:04:32.304 --> 00:04:33.806
Momentum!"

00:04:33.806 --> 00:04:39.078
Wow. Yep, that's about the only
momentum Trump has right now.

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:42.114
10 feet.
The last 10 feet, he ran?

00:04:42.114 --> 00:04:44.984
[ Laughing ] Oh, my gosh.

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:46.952
You know, there's so much
to say about the ramp video,

00:04:46.952 --> 00:04:49.288
and I just can't pick one joke,
so I'm going to tell

00:04:49.288 --> 00:04:52.091
as many jokes as I can
in the time it took Trump

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:53.425
to walk down that ramp.

00:04:53.425 --> 00:04:55.861
You ready? Let's go.

00:04:55.861 --> 00:04:57.997
He was just doing an impression
of his approval rating.

00:04:57.997 --> 00:04:59.365
[ Ding ]

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:01.467
That was still faster than
his response to the coronavirus.

00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:03.803
[ Ding ]

00:05:03.803 --> 00:05:06.005
He broke his first
Fitbit record of 10 steps.

00:05:06.005 --> 00:05:07.973
He looked like skier doing pizza
instead of French fries.

00:05:07.973 --> 00:05:09.275
[ Ding ]

00:05:09.275 --> 00:05:11.878
That's his audition tape for
"American Ninja Warrior."

00:05:11.878 --> 00:05:13.079
It would be faster if
he sat at the top

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:14.146
and did a butt scooch down.

00:05:14.146 --> 00:05:17.082
[ Buzzer ]
Oh! Alright. Alright.

00:05:17.082 --> 00:05:20.420
I got some in there.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:21.520
I had a couple more.
Want me to just tell you?

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.721
-Mm-hmm.

00:05:22.721 --> 00:05:24.456
-He still hasn't realized
it's not an escalator.

00:05:24.456 --> 00:05:26.492
[ Both laugh ]

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.130
That's right --
Trump said that the ramp

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.365
had no handrails
and was very slippery.

00:05:33.365 --> 00:05:34.533
He really came down hard on it,

00:05:34.533 --> 00:05:36.636
and I don't know if
he's going to let it go.

00:05:36.636 --> 00:05:39.105
Check out this new attack ad
he just released.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:41.474
-There's a new threat
in our country,

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:44.544
an enemy of the state
like we've never seen before...

00:05:44.544 --> 00:05:45.711
the ramp.

00:05:45.711 --> 00:05:47.312
We already know the ramp
is taking jobs

00:05:47.312 --> 00:05:49.215
from hardworking
American stairs,

00:05:49.215 --> 00:05:52.117
but who is the ramp really?

00:05:52.117 --> 00:05:54.086
A known member of Antifa?

00:05:54.086 --> 00:05:55.754
A foreign agent?

00:05:55.754 --> 00:05:58.157
Or a deep-state Liberal elite?

00:05:58.157 --> 00:06:02.695
Can we stop the spread
or is it already too late?

00:06:02.695 --> 00:06:04.630
Paid for by
Americans Against Ramps.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.666
-Yeah, it's been a rough
few months for Trump,

00:06:06.666 --> 00:06:09.168
but at least his family is
sticking by his side.

00:06:09.168 --> 00:06:10.903
-President Trump's niece
is coming out with

00:06:10.903 --> 00:06:14.407
a tell-all book about her
family and revealing

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:17.776
she has been a key
anonymous source for reporters

00:06:17.776 --> 00:06:20.146
looking into
the president's finances.

00:06:20.146 --> 00:06:22.582
-Yeah, okay, maybe not.

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:24.149
Another Trump tell-all book.

00:06:24.149 --> 00:06:26.452
It's crazy that,
after all these tell-all books,

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:29.021
there's still more to tell.

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:30.856
Trump's tell-all books
are starting to feel like

00:06:30.856 --> 00:06:32.491
a 3:00 a.m. infomercial.

00:06:32.491 --> 00:06:34.192
"But wait! There's more!"

00:06:34.192 --> 00:06:36.529
Okay, so, the Supreme Court
ruled against him,

00:06:36.529 --> 00:06:37.963
there's viral video about him,

00:06:37.963 --> 00:06:39.766
and a family member
has turned on him.

00:06:39.766 --> 00:06:41.634
I'm sure there couldn't
possibly be

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:44.203
any other bad news for
Trump, right?

00:06:44.203 --> 00:06:48.106
-The FDA announced that it is
ending the emergency use of

00:06:48.106 --> 00:06:51.944
hydroxychloroquine and
chloroquine to treat
coronavirus.

00:06:51.944 --> 00:06:54.847
-Trump was like,
"This is ridiculous.

00:06:54.847 --> 00:06:56.248
I've been taking it every day

00:06:56.248 --> 00:06:59.752
and I feel
coconut, tricycle, waterfall."

00:07:02.921 --> 00:07:08.528
Trump reminded the FDA that it
only works -- [ Laughs ]

00:07:08.528 --> 00:07:11.264
Trump reminded the FDA that it
only works when you take it

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:13.032
with a full glass of bleach.

00:07:13.032 --> 00:07:14.400
Yeah.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:17.403
[ As Trump ]
Who's the scientist now?

00:07:17.403 --> 00:07:18.871
What?

